<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1783"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Interested<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Interested<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->11-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, December 12, 2004 - 3:46 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Ok here goes,I think he is killing people that he knew in school or that somehow .....blew him off.Women that he had asked out and they said no or something along those lines.The picture could have been from a year book?could have been his kids yearbook<!--/Text--></td></tr>
